          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man udul mange mi ju m’ufoyo foc gicidho rombo kugi, man alubo ng’eigi, karacelo ku ng’et dhanu, wi gang’kidi, wi otkur mir uka, cil ba gang’kidi ma lac, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "man wi dhugang’ pa Efraim, man ba dhugang’ ma con, man ba dhugang’ mi rec, ku otkur pa Hananel, man otkur pa Hamea, cil ba dhugang’ mi rombe: e gicungo ti i dhugang’ pa jakur. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Udul ario mi ju m’ufoyo foc i ot pa Mungu gicungo kumeni, man an, ku ng’et jubim wakugi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "man julam ke, Eliakim, man Maseya, man Miniamin, man Mikaya, man Elioenai, man Zekaria, man Hanania, kud agwara; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "man Maseya, ku Cemaya, man Eleazar, man Uzi, man Yehohanan, man Malkija, man Elam man Ezer. E juwer giwero ma tek, ku Yezrahia ma jawigi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E gimio lam ma dit i ceng’ maeca, man anyong’a negogi; kum Mungu ketho anyong’a nyai ku mutoro ma dit; e mon ku nyithindho bende anyong’a negogi: ketho nia juwinjo mutoro mi Yerusalem ku bor.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.43"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
